# ALPHA MACHINE MEMORY MAP
## Target Profile: CONTRACT-QEMU-VIRT-AARCH64-M1

| Address Window | Size | Classification | Alignment | Access Rights | Purpose |
| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |
| `0x00000000 - 0x0000017F` | 384 B | Flash / Code | 64-byte | Read / Execute | `alpha.bin` canonical root executable image |
| `0x00000180 - 0x03FFFFFF` | ~64 MiB | Flash / Unused | 4 KiB | Read Only | Reserved Flash address space |
| `0x09000000 - 0x09000FFF` | 4 KiB | MMIO Peripheral | 4-byte | Read / Write | ARM PrimeCell PL011 UART diagnostic output |
| `0x40000000 - 0x400FFFFF` | 1 MiB | DRAM Reserved | 64 KiB | Unused by Alpha | QEMU Virt Device Tree Blob (DTB) staging window |
| `0x40100000 - 0x401EFFFF` | 960 KiB | DRAM Unused | 4 KiB | Unused by Alpha | Free memory reserved for Physics |
| `0x401FE000 - 0x401FE03F` | 64 B | DRAM Scratchpad | 64-byte | Read / Write | Machine Boot Descriptor generated by Alpha |
| `0x401FE040 - 0x401FEFFF` | 4 KiB | DRAM Scratchpad | 16-byte | Read / Write | Scratchpad working memory |
| `0x401FF000` | Anchor | DRAM Stack Top | 16-byte | Stack Pointer | Initial Stack Pointer (`SP_EL1` / `SP_EL2`) |
| `0x40200000 - 0x402000FF` | 256 B | DRAM Payload | 64-byte | Read / Execute | `PHYSICS-0` initial machine authority payload image |
| `0x40200100 - 0x47FFFFFF` | ~126 MiB | DRAM Free | 4 KiB | Unused by Alpha | System RAM available for Physics kernel allocation |
